Thank you for installing typerelay-server.

This is a self-hosted deployment. Do NOT set TYPERELAY_HOSTED_EDITION=true
or BILLING_ENABLED=true; those are for the SaaS/cloud service only.

Required services:
  - MongoDB  (MONGO_URI)
  - Memcached (MEMCACHED_SERVERS)

Configuration:
  Copy the sample env file and adjust:
      cp ${ETCDIR}/typerelay-server.env /usr/local/etc/typerelay-server.env
      # then edit /usr/local/etc/typerelay-server.env

  Key variables (see .env.example):
      MONGO_URI, MEMCACHED_SERVERS, PORT (default 3000), APP_URL,
      API_BASE_URL, MCP_BASE_URL, API_ALLOWED_ORIGINS, MCP_ALLOWED_ORIGINS,
      JWT_SECRET

Optional:
  - Stripe billing (Stripe keys, webhook secret) if enabling billing
  - SAML (node-saml) for enterprise authentication

Service:
  Enable with:  sysrc typerelay_server_enable=YES
  Start with:   service typerelay-server start
